  "what_this_shows": "34 mechanically derived wrong actions on 9 real shell transformations in a real directory: a replay differential catches 1.0 of them under a full state observation (0.0 silently identical), 0.9706 under a name-and-size observation (0.0294 silently identical) and 0.7647 under a listing (0.2353 silently identical). That completeness is not a property of the agent: without a recorded consequence -- novel work, where there is nothing to replay -- only crashes and no-ops are visible, so density falls to 0.5 even with a full digest. Computer-use check density is therefore neither zero nor fixed: it is set by how much of the state the agent can see, and by whether it has a consequence to compare against."
